      "created_at": "2018-11-27T02:53:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Plague Rat in Magmaria vs. The Sentinels, Void Guard Dr. Medico, Void Guard Idealist, Void Guard Mainstay, and Void Guard Writhe.</p>\n<p>Final HP for me was 8/14/0/8, 23, 21, 22, 19. Idealist should have been up and back at 'em at the end but I misplayed the Sentinels'&nbsp;final card.</p>\n<p>Both Writhes were instrumental in the ease of victory, as Caliginous Form kept regular Writhe healthy, while VG Writhe had the Cloak and Umbral Siphon for the entire game.</p>\n<p>Afflicted Frenzy only had the chance to go off once, hitting Medico in the middle of a Regeneration cycle, so he just shrugged it off.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:13.322Z",
