      "id": 224400,
      "name": "QuirkyDM",
      "username": "QuirkyDM",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-11-27T03:07:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Heh, I took too long between starting my thread on this and posting. Ninja'd by bolnerap.</p>\n<p>Fairly easy mint with everyone except Void Guard Dr. Medico near full health. There is way too much healing for Plague Rat's 1 damage per round to do much of anything. Two Dr. Medico's provided all the healing needed and then some while&nbsp;Writhe kept Plague Rat's deck full of ongoing cards that VG Idealist destroyed while delivering some beatdowns of her own. Writhe was the only one who was infected and Caliginous Form redirected his start of turn damage to Plague&nbsp;Rat. Writhe even kept trying to grab a magma hot crystal from the lava, but Plague Rat kept jumping in the way of that. :) VG Mainstay focused on damage, but Plague Rat ended up KO'd before he could even bother playing most of his decent cards.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
