      "created_at": "2018-11-27T05:33:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Nothing like a relaxing game of plauge rat, eh?&nbsp; Mint at 13/14/11/14, 24, 23, 26, 19.&nbsp; Had a lot of turns where Mainstay sat around doing nothing but swing his belter, and Writhe did a lot of stabbing with the syphon, but aside from that and infecting Medico I pretty much played everyone normally.</p>",
