      "created_at": "2018-11-27T13:41:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A fun and easy Mint. Magmaria wasn't a big problem -- only saw one Behemoth, which was nice -- and I unlocked Cosmic Writhe by the end! :D</p>\n<p>I think my favorite thing was leaving the Magma Crystal in play and letting Sentinels Writhe redirect a free 1 fire damage to Plague Rat every round.</p>",
