    {
      "id": 224407,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-11-28T18:15:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Headlock is indeed dangerous and should be used with care--it's most useful against targets that have serious damage reduction themselves.&nbsp; I find it most useful for \"tiny tanks\" like Hugin and Runes of Malediction.&nbsp; As for voluntarily destroying his own stuff, it's most useful either for a last hurrah or for when you have a replacement waiting in the wings.</p>",
