      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e8c25b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-11-28T19:35:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I can see how headlock would be extremely useful against a minion or object with high damage reduction that doesn't normally do damage itself. Not really applicable against Plague Rat, but there are cards out there that can be a huge pain. Runes of Malediction probably tops that list.</p>",
