      "created_at": "2018-11-28T20:11:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint, and I actually played twice to experiment.&nbsp; Writhe with Caliginous Form and Infection is pretty funny, but&nbsp;Doctor Medico with Hippocratic Oath, Infection, and two Afflicted Frenzies in play is&nbsp;hilarious.&nbsp; Somehow I even managed to kill Plague Rat with healing (which I reported).</p>",
